      hu: "Kuvait város régi vámkapuja a fallal körülvett város bejárata volt a 18. században. A kapu tömör fából készült, vassal megerősítve. Itt szedték be a vámot a behozott áruk után. A kapu a városfal része volt, amely védte a települést. Az 1950-es években lebontották a városfejlesztés miatt. Ma egy rekonstrukció áll a helyén emlékül.",
      ro: "Poarta Vamală Veche din Kuwait City era intrarea în orașul fortificat, construită în secolul al XVIII-lea. Era o poartă masivă din lemn cu herghelii de fier. Aici se percepeau taxe vamale pentru mărfurile importate. Poarta făcea parte din zidul orașului. A fost demolată în anii 1950 pentru modernizare. O replică a fost ridicată ulterior pentru a comemora istoria.",
      en: "Kuwait City Old Customs Gate was the main entrance to the walled city, built in the 18th century. It was a large wooden gate reinforced with iron, where customs duties were collected. It was part of the city wall that protected against raids. The gate was demolished in the 1950s during urban expansion. A replica was later constructed to preserve its memory. It symbolizes Kuwait's trading heritage.",
